⚠️ **Security**: This hardcoded dev key is compiled into the binary and used when `AGENTHUB_SECRET_KEY` is not set. Consider logging a prominent startup warning when the fallback key is active, so operators don't accidentally run production instances with the dev key.

Suggested code:
```rust
if std::env::var("AGENTHUB_SECRET_KEY").is_err() {
    tracing::warn!("AGENTHUB_SECRET_KEY not set — using INSECURE development key");
}
```

